# Sealed expectation for kitty-featq-payload.case, written from upload-rules.md before any implementation.
# Replies are exact. A '# expected in the dump' line says in words what the frame view must show.
> size 20 10
> send "\e_Ga=q,i=47,e=t,f=24,s=1,v=1;AAAA\e\\"
< reply "\e_Gi=47,e=t,f=24,s=1,v=1;OK\e\\"
> send "\e_Ga=p,i=47,C=1\e\\"
< reply "\e_Gi=47;ENOENT:Put command refers to non-existent image with id: 47 and number: 0\e\\"
